# UI/UX Design Hackathon - Make Tutedude Feel Like Tutedude.

# Background

You are a Tutedude student. So we are not going to explain Tutedude to you. You already know how the mentorship works, what the campus feels like and what the refund is.

Here it is in one place anyway, because you will have to decide what goes on the page and what stays off it.

1. A complete end to end course. Lifetime access, even after the refund.
2. A community of likeminded students.
3. Real world projects, challenges and tasks.
4. Live 1:1 mentorship with an industry expert. 
5. A learning dashboard with gamified features.
6. A completion certificate from Tutedude.
7. All of it bundled inside an immersive virtual campus.
8. And above all this, **100% of the money back on finishing it in three months.**

We sell this in three ways. Single courses. Combo packs of four or more courses. And an All Access Pack that opens every course on the platform.

What you have probably never looked at closely is our website. The Home Page and the Course Landing Page. Those two pages are where somebody who has never heard of us decides whether this place is real and whether to pay for it.

That is the job. Right now those pages are not doing it well enough.

---

# The Problem

The Home Page and the Course Landing Page are where somebody who has never heard of Tutedude decides whether this place is real and whether to pay for it. A lot of them decide no.

Three things go wrong there.

1. **Nobody can tell what Tutedude actually is.**
    1. Everything we give a learner is sitting on that page somewhere. It still reads like every other course site in India. What this place is does not reach the person reading it.
2. **The 100% Refund Offer does not land.**
    1. It is the strongest thing we sell and the least understood. People read it and leave thinking it is a trick, or thinking it is free and therefore cheap. Neither is true. Both cost us the sale. Go and read the offer everywhere it appears on the site and you will see the problem yourself.
3. **The page does not sell.**
    1. Everything Tutedude promises, courses that are effectively free, 100% money back, IIT Delhi alumni initiative, placement support, sounds too good to be true. The proof is real and it's all there. The pages just don't make anyone feel it. Turn our claims into proof.

You know this product from the inside. Now look at both pages as a stranger and work out why they fail. Your task is to redesign these two pages so all three happen.

