# What you should not do

1. Do not use our current colours, fonts or layout. Start on a clean page.
2. Do not change the logo. That is the one thing that stays.
3. Do not invent features we do not have. Everything on the page must be something Tutedude actually gives.
4. Do not leave lorem ipsum anywhere. Copy is half of what we are scoring.
5. Do not design the dashboard, the app, the checkout or any inner page. Two pages only.
6. Do not copy an existing edtech site and change the colours. We will know.

**Take your time to understand the problem. Do not jump into Figma directly. Think like a user. Think like a real person who is trying to get things done with less confusion and less waiting.**

