# Who is it for?

A twenty year old student in a tier two city. A fresher who did not get placed. A working person who wants to switch fields and has one hour a day. They have a phone, a tight budget and a lot of doubt. Many of them have already been burned by an online course, or know somebody who was.

They are not designers. They will not read your clever headline twice. They decide in a few seconds whether this place is real.

So write for them. Not for Dribbble, not for your portfolio, not for the judge.

**Show your design to someone at home who has never heard of Tutedude. If they cannot tell you what we do, what we have and how the refund works after one scroll, go back and fix it.**

Take your time to understand the brand before you open Figma. Look at the site. Read our FAQs. See how we talk today. Then decide how we should talk tomorrow.

